{"candidateAnswer":"Last week before 9 April 2023","evidence":"[D12:1 | 4:30 pm on 9 April, 2023] Deborah: Hey Jolene! Great to see you! Had a blast biking nearby with my neighbor last week - was so freeing and beautiful. Checked out an art show with a friend today - really cool and inspiring stuff. Reminded me of my mom.","itemId":"urn:uuid:e6104b1c-c133-5ba0-ae6b-0909e294af0b","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:0502de09564d6e5a343366c148b05d3bd6d92a4986a957e10cd540e98a09b990","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"When did Deborah go for a bicycle ride with Anna?","referenceAnswer":"first week of April, 2023","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"0502de09564d6e5a343366c148b05d3bd6d92a4986a957e10cd540e98a09b990"}}]}